# The enchanted creature also triggers when blocking a toughness-3 creature, destroying the attacker at end of combat and receiving a counter at end step (CR 603.2).
[Bot1 Deck]
Infinite Authority
Black Lotus
Ornithopter
Plains x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Phyrexian Walker
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Hand.Infinite Authority.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
? Bot1.Mana =
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Phyrexian Walker.Cast
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Phyrexian Walker > Bot1)
Bot1.Block(Ornithopter > Bot2.Battlefield.Phyrexian Walker)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]
? Bot2.Graveyard = Phyrexian Walker
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 0
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 3
